# Public DocxEdit repository — everything except README.md is excluded from git.
# Source code, tests, scripts, changelogs and other docs live only in the
# maintainer's local working tree. Public distribution goes through GitHub
# Releases (DMG + SHA256SUMS attached to each release).

# Whitelist approach: ignore everything, then re-include the few tracked files.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# macOS junk (defensive; already covered by /* but explicit).
.DS_Store
